        {
          "id": 825352387,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Thanks for that Jaap. I'll be working on more additions for VSNP, so I'll put in the changes you reviewed for my next merge request.\n\nOn a related note: I'm new to contributing to open source - as a rule of thumb, how many lines of code should I write before submitting a merge request? The next change will be a lot bigger than this, and I don't want to make reviewing a pain.",
